 "about_text": "KOMIYAMA TOKYO G is a gallery space in Tokyo's Kanda-Jimbocho book district, launched in 2022 by the century-old secondhand bookstore Komiyama Shoten. It presents solo exhibitions and group shows spanning photography, illustration, ceramics, tattoo art, fashion and fetish culture, often mixing the bookstore's archival material with contemporary artists' work. Throughout the year it also hosts art book fairs and publication-related exhibitions tied to photobooks and artist monographs. The program favors emerging and cult-following artists working in painting, ceramics, digital/CG art, airbrush illustration, and documentary photography, reflecting the eclectic subcultural interests of its bookstore origins.",
